  S1  b1[n] = ((b1[(n - 1)] + a1[n]) + d[n]);   sequential: recurrence
  edges: S0 -> S1 a1 {=} d=0 (flow); S1 -> S1 b1 {<} d=1 (flow)
  blocks: [S0] [S1]cyclic

