  S0  a2[n] = (a2[n] + (b2[n] .* c[n]));   hoisted
  S1  e2[n] = (e2[(n - 1)] * e2[(n - 1)]);   sequential: recurrence
  S2  a2[n] = (a2[n] - (b2[n] .* c[n]));   hoisted
  edges: S0 -> S2 a2 {=} d=0 (flow); S0 -> S2 a2 {=} d=0 (anti); S0 -> S2 a2 {=} d=0 (output); S1 -> S1 e2 {<} d=1 (flow)
